      "modulesPageFaqTitle": "Straight answers about the catalog.",
      "modulesPageFaqBody": "Live vs limited status, getting started, and how specialists fit in.",
      "modulesPageFaq1q": "What does “Live” vs “Limited” mean?",
      "modulesPageFaq1a": "Live modules are in production today with working backends. Limited modules appear in navigation with honest empty states until their service work ships — we do not pretend they are finished.",
      "modulesPageFaq2q": "How do we get started with these modules?",
      "modulesPageFaq2a": "Register your school on the public form. After approval, your tenant receives plan entitlements that unlock the matching modules for your staff and families.",
      "modulesPageFaq3q": "Are campus specialists (clinic, library, transport) included?",
      "modulesPageFaq3a": "Yes — they appear in the catalog under Campus specialists. Availability on your tenant still follows the plan’s feature entitlements and any school-level overrides after approval.",
      "modulesPageFaq4q": "Can one organization run multiple schools?",
      "modulesPageFaq4a": "Each school is a separate tenant with its own slug, staff, and entitlements. Multi-school groups typically register each campus; Super Admin can align plans across them.",
      "modulesPageFaq5q": "Where do seat limits and prices show up?",
      "modulesPageFaq5a": "List prices, seats, and storage are on the Pricing page — they come from the live Plans catalog, not invented marketing numbers.",
