      "pricingPageFaq2a": "Core portal, parent portal, communications, notifications, attendance, classrooms, calendar, and documents — within Free seat and storage quotas. See the comparison matrix for the exact key list.",
      "pricingPageFaq3q": "How does school registration work?",
      "pricingPageFaq3a": "Submit the public register form. We review the application, provision the tenant, and apply the appropriate plan entitlements. You do not complete a platform Stripe checkout on this marketing site.",
